{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A chaotic co-op road trip where everything that can go wrong\u2026 does.</strong><br><strong>You and your friends hit the road to find the next breaking news.</strong>  <br><strong>The crazier it gets, the more your stream blows up.</strong>  <br><strong>How many viewers can you get while staying alive? Storms, UFOs, T-Rexes... </strong>   <br><strong>You'll never guess what'll be next.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa5 <strong>GO VIRAL</strong> \u2013 Every disaster boosts your live viewers count! Get the best shots, crash big, scream louder, sacrifice your friends\u00a0\u2014 and watch the numbers climb.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude90 <strong>1-4 Players\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Drive and argue as your van falls apart from the next looming the disaster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf2a\ufe0f <strong>Disasters</strong> \u2013 Aliens, tornadoes, angels, titans, portals, giant holes\u2014every road is a new nightmare.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd27 <strong>Upgrades</strong> \u2013 Unlock upgrades that help you stay alive and livestreaming for longer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <strong>Road Trip</strong> \u2013 Unpredictable road trip chaos as you chase catastrophes around the globe, until you inevitably die from filming a little bit too much.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0a <strong>Proximity Voice Chat</strong> \u2013 Panic and laugh in real-time as the audience count climbs sky high.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Would you save your friends, or your stream?<br>All you have to do is stay on air. How hard can that be?</strong></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4130890?t=1765229553","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/